      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5995863::chunk::001::introduction::a6c9e13965"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "V substitution at x approximately 0.2–0.3 will not disrupt phase stability.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The modified alloy will retain a BCC or BCC+B2 microstructure.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "V is sufficiently size-compatible with Hf that lattice distortion will be maintained.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Solid-solution strengthening dominates in the retained microstructure.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Maintained lattice distortion and chemical interactions will preserve favorable dislocation interactions.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The favorable dislocation interactions and phase stability underpin room-temperature strength and toughness and high-temperature yield strength.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The modified alloy will have a density 5–10% below the 10.21 g/cm³ baseline.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The modified alloy will retain 90–100% of the baseline 1600 MPa room-temperature yield strength.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The modified alloy will retain a yield strength near 855 MPa at 1000 °C.",
